[{"text":"FCLoopCreateFactorizingRules[ints, topos] processes the given list of GLIs and corresponding topologies and returns a list of rules for replacing all factorizing integrals by simpler integrals with less loops.","anchor":"fcloopcreatefactorizingrules"},{"text":"Notice that we automatically generate suitable FCTopology objects for the simpler integrals. Using the options PreferredTopologies or PreferredIntegrals those can be mapped to a desired set.","anchor":"fcloopcreatefactorizingrules"},{"text":"Overview, FCLoopFactorizingQ, FCLoopCreateFactorizingRules.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"masters = Get@FileNameJoin[{$FeynCalcDirectory, \"Documentation\", \"Examples\", \"MasterIntegrals\", \"mastersBMixing3L.m\"}];","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"topos = Get@FileNameJoin[{$FeynCalcDirectory, \"Documentation\", \"Examples\", \"MasterIntegrals\", \"toposBMixing3L.m\"}];","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"```mathematica FCLoopCreateFactorizingRules[masters[[1 ;; 50]], topos]","anchor":"cb2-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"```mathematica","anchor":"cb2-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FCLoopCreateFactorizingRules: }\\;\\text{Number of factorizing integrals: }11\\]","anchor":"cb2-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FCLoopCreateFactorizingRules: }\\;\\text{Number of simpler integrals: }6\\]","anchor":"cb2-2","section":"Examples"}]